Sentence 2: Police forces of Nazi Germany
Police forces of Nazi Germany There were three police forces in the Third Reich under the "Chef der Deutschen Polizei und Reichsführer-SS" Heinrich Himmler: In 1939 the "Sipo" and "SD" were combined to form the Reichssicherheitshauptamt (RSHA).
