Sentence 1: Everybody Loves a Happy Ending
Everybody Loves a Happy Ending Everybody Loves a Happy Ending is the sixth studio album by the British pop-rock band Tears for Fears, released on 14 September 2004 in the US, and 7 March 2005 in the UK and Europe.
