Sentence 4: Sari-sari store
a constant feature of residential neighborhoods in the Philippines both in rural and urban areas, proliferating even in the poorest communities.
Sentence 5: About ninety-three percent (93%) of all Sari-sari stores nationwide are located in residential communities.
Sentence 6: The neighborhood Sari-sari store (variety or general) is part and parcel of daily life for the average Filipino.
