Sentence 2: The area is centered on Brazos County, the cities of College Station and Bryan, and Texas A&M University.
Sentence 3: College Station, Texas
College Station, Texas College Station is a city in Brazos County, Texas, situated in East-Central Texas in the heart of the Brazos Valley, in the center of the region known as Texas Triangle.
Sentence 4: College Station and Bryan together make up the Bryan-College Station metropolitan area, the 14th-largest metropolitan area in Texas with 255,589 people as of 2015.
