Sentence 3: After the killing of Piet Retief and his delegation (about a hundred persons), the Zulu King Dingane sent his impis to kill the remaining voortrekkers who were camped at Doringkop, Bloukrans (Blaauwekrans), Moordspruit, Rensburgspruit and other sites along the Bushman River (), in the present province of KwaZulu-Natal, South Africa.
