Sentence 2: Second Schleswig War
Second Schleswig War The Second Schleswig War (; ) was the second military conflict over the Schleswig-Holstein Question of the nineteenth century.
Sentence 3: Like the First Schleswig War (1848–52), it was fought for control of the duchies of Holstein and Lauenburg, due to the succession disputes concerning them when the Danish king died without an heir acceptable to the German Confederation.
